♫ In the world

00:11:36.538 --> 00:11:38.509
What the fuck am I doing?

00:11:38.509 --> 00:11:41.240
♫ Light deep inside

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.073
Oh, sorry.

00:11:42.073 --> 00:11:45.656
