00:11:48.828 --> 00:11:50.199
What the fuck.

00:11:50.199 --> 00:11:51.032
Oh god.

00:11:51.032 --> 00:11:51.865
This is, no.

00:11:51.865 --> 00:11:54.040
I didn't know it was this.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.790
How am I supposed to?

00:11:59.361 --> 00:12:00.194
Oh god.

00:12:00.194 --> 00:12:02.330
No, no, no.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.747
Don't look at me!

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.539
You like it.

